How does this Project work?
Admin can view,edit,delete all tasks of the managers and employees 
Admin can view,edit,delete all the managers and employees
Admin can generate all the tasks of the managers and employees and can download it as a PDF
Admin can assign tasks to managers and employees

Managers can add, view, edit and delete their own tasks and managers can add, view, edit and delete the tasks of employees if they have the same office
Managers can generate their own tasks by selecting a date range, managers can also generate the tasks by selecting a data range of the employees if they have the same office and the managers can also download it as a PDF

Employees can only add view edit and delete their own tasks
Employees can only generate and download their tasks by selecting a date range.


